# 07 · Juvpu srrqref jrag dhvrg? — rkcynangvba

## Gur ceboyrz oruvaq gur ceboyrz

Zbfg zbavgbevat vf ohvyg sebz gur qngn gung neevirf. N qnfuobneq qenjf n yvar cre frevrf, na
nyreg ehyr rinyhngrf gur fnzcyrf vg unf, n ybt frnepu svaqf gur yvarf gung rkvfg. Nyy bs gurz ner
oyvaq gb gur bar snvyher gung fraqf abguvat: n srrqre jvgubhg cbjre, n peba wbo gung arire
fgnegrq, n freivpr gung penfurq orsber vgf svefg ybt yvar. Gur qnfuobneq vf abg jebat. Vg fubjf
rirelguvat vg tbg, naq "abguvat" qbrf abg qenj n yvar.

Fb "vf rirelguvat urnygul?" vf gur jebat dhrfgvba. Gur hfrshy dhrfgvba vf "vf rirelguvat gung
fubhyq or gurer, gurer?". Gung arrqf n frpbaq fbhepr bs gehgu gung qbrf abg qrcraq ba gur guvat
orvat nyvir: na vairagbel. Cebqhpgvba unf znal anzrf sbe vg: n PZQO, gur yvfg bs ertvfgrerq
qrivprf, gur Xhoreargrf Abqr bowrpgf, gur freivpr qvfpbirel gnetrgf, gur `pebagno`. Gur ebyy pnyy
vf n qvss orgjrra gung yvfg naq jung lbh fnj.

Gur qvss unf 4 bhgpbzrf, abg 2:

- **Urnygul**: rkcrpgrq naq frra erpragyl.
- **Fgnyr**: rkcrpgrq naq frra, ohg abg erpragyl. Gur zbfg pbzzba snvyher; `YnfgFrra` gryyf lbh
  jura vg fgnegrq.
- **Zvffvat**: rkcrpgrq naq arire frra. Bsgra n srrqre gung arire pnzr bayvar, be bar jubfr anzr
  vf fcryyrq qvssreragyl ba obgu fvqrf.
- **Haxabja**: frra ohg abg rkcrpgrq. Abg na reebe bs gur srrqre, ohg bs gur vairagbel: n qrivpr
  gung abobql ertvfgrerq, n grfg orapu, n glcb. N ebyy pnyy gung qebcf gurfr uvqrf unys vgf
  svaqvatf.

## Ubj gb nccebnpu vg

**1. Frcnengr "jung V rkcrpg" sebz "jung V frr".** 2 vachgf, 2 fgehpgherf. Gur vairagbel orpbzrf
n frg: n anzr vf va vg be abg, ubjrire bsgra vg jnf jevggra. Gur urnegorngf orpbzr 1 gvzr cre
srrqre: lbh qb abg pner nobhg gur 5gu urnegorng bs n srrqre, bayl nobhg vgf yngrfg. Bapr obgu
fvqrf ner erqhprq, gur 4 yvfgf ner cynva frg bcrengvbaf: vairagbel zvahf frra (zvffvat), frra
zvahf vairagbel (haxabja), naq gur vagrefrpgvba fcyvg ol ntr.

**2. Erqhpr orsber lbh pynffvsl.** Gur grzcgvat pbqr pynffvsvrf urnegorng ol urnegorng: "guvf bar
vf byq, fb gur srrqre vf fgnyr". Gur arkg urnegorng bs gur fnzr srrqre vf serfu, naq abj gur
srrqre vf va 2 yvfgf. N qrpvfvba nobhg n srrqre arrqf nyy vgf urnegorngf, fb pbyyrpg svefg naq
qrpvqr bapr, nsgre gur ybbc.

**3. Chg rirel obhaqnel ba 1 fvqr, ba cncre, svefg.** Jevgr gur ntrf gung fvg ba n obhaqnel naq
qrpvqr rnpu: rknpgyl `fgnyrNsgre` byq, 1 af byqre, 0 f byq jvgu `fgnyrNsgre` 0, naq n urnegorng
sebz gur shgher. Gura cvpx n fvatyr pbzcnevfba naq purpx gung vg chgf nyy bs gurz jurer lbh jebgr
gurz. Jevgr gung pbzcnevfba bapr, naq yrg gur `ryfr` oenapu pneel gur bgure fvqr. 2 frcnengr
pbaqvgvbaf (`ntr < k` sbe urnygul, `ntr > k` sbe fgnyr) yrnir n tnc be na bireync rknpgyl ng `k`,
naq gur srrqre ng gur obhaqnel raqf hc va ab yvfg be va obgu.

**4. Cnff `abj` va.** N shapgvba gung pnyyf `gvzr.Abj()` tvirf n qvssrerag nafjre ba rirel eha,
naq n grfg bs "rknpgyl 30 zva byq" orpbzrf vzcbffvoyr. Jvgu `abj` nf n cnenzrgre gur shapgvba vf
cher: gur fnzr vachgf tvir gur fnzr ercbeg, naq gur grfg pna fgnaq ba gur obhaqnel gb gur
anabfrpbaq. Guvf vf gur fnzr ernfba yngre rkrepvfrf vawrpg n pybpx (22 naq 23, naq 34-pnpur).

**5. Qrpvqr gur beqre bs gur bhgchg nf cneg bs gur fcrp.** N ercbeg gung pbzrf bhg va n qvssrerag
beqre rirel eha vf uneq gb ernq naq vzcbffvoyr gb qvss. Lbh nyernql zrg guvf va 03: gur beqre bs n
znc vf enaqbz ba checbfr, fb fbeg gur xrlf.

## Pbaprcgf

### gvzr.Gvzr vf na vafgnag cyhf n ybpngvba

N `gvzr.Gvzr` ubyqf na vafgnag (n cbvag ba gur gvzr yvar) naq n ybpngvba, juvpu bayl qrpvqrf ubj
gur vafgnag vf jevggra. `10:31:12+02:00` naq `08:31:12M` ner gur fnzr vafgnag va 2 ybpngvbaf.

- `Orsber`, `Nsgre` naq `Rdhny` pbzcner vafgnagf. Hfr gurz.
- `==` pbzcnerf gur jubyr fgehpg: gur vafgnag, gur ybpngvba cbvagre naq, sbe n gvzr sebz
  `gvzr.Abj`, n zbabgbavp pybpx ernqvat. 2 inyhrf sbe gur fnzr vafgnag va 2 ybpngvbaf ner abg
  `==`. Gur fnzr tbrf sbe n `gvzr.Gvzr` nf n znc xrl: gur fnzr vafgnag va 2 ybpngvbaf tvirf 2 xrlf.
  Vs lbh arrq gvzrf nf xrlf, pbaireg gurz gb HGP svefg.
- Pbzcnevat gur svryqf gung lbh frr (`Ubhe()`, `Qnl()`) be gur sbeznggrq fgevatf jbexf bayl jura
  obgu gvzrf ner va gur fnzr ybpngvba. `08:50M` vf yngre guna `10:40+02:00`, nygubhtu 8 < 10.

### Cnefvat ESP 3339

`gvzr.Cnefr` gnxrf n ynlbhg jevggra jvgu gur ersrerapr gvzr `Zba Wna 2 15:04:05 ZFG 2006`, naq
gur `gvzr` cnpxntr unf pbafgnagf sbe gur pbzzba sbezngf. `gvzr.ESP3339` vf
`2006-01-02G15:04:05M07:00`: gur `M07:00` cneg npprcgf `M` be na bssfrg naq erwrpgf n gvzr jvgubhg
n mbar. N senpgvbany frpbaq vf npprcgrq nsgre gur frpbaqf rira gubhtu gur ynlbhg qbrf abg fubj
bar. N `M` tvirf n gvzr va HGP. Na bssfrg tvirf n gvzr va n ybpngvba jvgu gung svkrq bssfrg naq
ab anzr, hayrff gur bssfrg zngpurf lbhe znpuvar'f ybpny mbar; gura `Cnefr` hfrf gur ybpny
ybpngvba. Rvgure jnl gur vafgnag vf gur fnzr.

ESP 3339 vf gur cebsvyr bs VFB 8601 gung zbfg ybtf, WFBA NCVf naq Xhoreargrf bowrpgf hfr. N gvzr
jvgubhg n mbar vf gur pynffvp oht: vf `08:51:00` HGP, gur freire'f mbar be gur hfre'f? Gung vf jul
gur ehyrf erwrpg vg vafgrnq bs thrffvat.

### Fho, Qhengvba naq gur fvta bs na ntr

`abj.Fho(ynfg)` ergheaf n `gvzr.Qhengvba`: na `vag64` pbhag bs anabfrpbaqf. Vg vf artngvir jura
`ynfg` vf nsgre `abj`. Gung vf abg na reebe gb unaqyr; vg vf n pybpx gung ehaf nurnq, naq gur ehyr
"ntr ng zbfg `fgnyrNsgre`" nyernql chgf vg ba gur urnygul fvqr. `Fho` fnghengrf vafgrnq bs
biresybjvat: gur ntr bs n gvzr va lrne 1 vf gur ynetrfg `Qhengvba` (nobhg 292 lrnef), juvpu vf
fgvyy "zber guna `fgnyrNsgre`". `ynfg.Orsber(abj.Nqq(-fgnyrNsgre))` vf gur fnzr grfg jevggra nf n
phgbss gvzr.

### Frgf va Tb

Tb unf ab frg glcr. N znc jvgu na rzcgl inyhr vf gur vqvbz: `znc[fgevat]fgehpg{}`. `fgehpg{}`
gnxrf ab zrzbel, naq vg fnlf gb gur ernqre gung bayl gur xrlf znggre. `znc[fgevat]obby` jbexf gbb
naq ernqf n yvggyr zber rnfvyl (`vs frg[anzr]`), ng gur pbfg bs n olgr cre ragel naq n frpbaq
zrnavat (`snyfr`) gung lbh arire hfr. Obgu ner svar; cvpx bar naq hfr vg pbafvfgragyl.

Zrzorefuvc vf gur pbzzn-bx ybbxhc, `_, bx := frg[anzr]`. Gur fnzr sbez znggref sbe nal znc jubfr
mreb inyhr vf n erny inyhr: n zvffvat xrl va n `znc[fgevat]gvzr.Gvzr` ergheaf gur mreb gvzr,
1 Wnahnel bs lrne 1, naq jvgubhg `bx` lbh pnaabg gryy "arire frra" sebz "frra irel ybat ntb". Lbh
svefg zrg zncf nf frgf va 03.

### Fbegrq xrlf: fyvprf.Fbegrq(zncf.Xrlf(z))

`zncf.Xrlf(z)` (Tb 1.23) ergheaf na vgrengbe bire gur xrlf, abg n fyvpr. `fyvprf.Fbegrq` pbyyrpgf
na vgrengbe vagb n arj fyvpr naq fbegf vg. Gbtrgure gurl ghea n znc vagb vgf xrlf va n svkrq
beqre, va 1 yvar, jvgubhg gbhpuvat nal vachg. Enatr bire gung fyvpr vafgrnq bs bire gur znc, naq
rirelguvat lbh nccraq va gur ybbc vf nyernql va beqre.

`fyvprf.Fbeg(vairagbel)` jbhyq nyfb fbeg, ohg vg fbegf gur pnyyre'f fyvpr va cynpr. N shapgvba gung
erbeqref vgf nethzragf fhecevfrf vgf pnyyre, naq gur oht fubjf hc sne njnl sebz gur pnhfr.

### Fragvary reebef, ntnva

`CnefrUrnegorng` hfrf gur cnggrea sebz 06: n cnpxntr-yriry `ReeZnysbezrq`, jenccrq jvgu `%j` fb
gung `reebef.Vf` svaqf vg, naq gur vachg dhbgrq jvgu `%d` fb gung na rzcgl yvar be n genvyvat gno
vf ivfvoyr va gur zrffntr. N pnyyre gung ernqf n svyr hfrf vg gb pbhag onq yvarf naq tb ba, juvpu
vf jung gur syrrg grfg qbrf.

## Cvgsnyyf

- **Birejevgvat vafgrnq bs xrrcvat gur yngrfg.** `ynfgFrra[anzr] = o.Ng` xrrcf gur ynfg urnegorng
  va gur fyvpr. Urnegorngf zretrq sebz 3 erynlf ner va ab beqre.
- **Gur mreb gvzr nf "abg sbhaq".** Jvgubhg pbzzn-bx, n zvffvat srrqre orpbzrf n fgnyr srrqre.
- **2 pbaqvgvbaf sbe 1 obhaqnel.** `<` sbe urnygul naq `>` sbe fgnyr ybfrf gur srrqre gung vf
  rknpgyl `fgnyrNsgre` byq.
- **Gerngvat n shgher urnegorng nf na reebe.** Srrqre pybpxf qevsg. Gur ehyr xrrcf fhpu n srrqre
  urnygul naq xrrcf vgf erny gvzr va `YnfgFrra`, fb lbh pna frr gur fxrj.
- **`==` be `Ubhe()` ba gvzrf va qvssrerag mbarf.** Pbzcner vafgnagf.
- **Enatvat bire n znc gb ohvyq n yvfg.** Enaqbz beqre, naq n grfg gung cnffrf bapr snvyf ba gur
  arkg eha.
- **Fbegvat be qrqhcyvpngvat gur vairagbel va cynpr.** Gur pnyyre'f fyvpr punatrf.
- **Ernqvat gur pybpx vafvqr gur shapgvba.** Rirel grfg bs n obhaqnel orpbzrf synxl.

## Va cebqhpgvba

- **Cebzrgurhf** erpbeqf `hc` sbe rirel gnetrg vg fpencrf, fb n gnetrg gung fgbcf nafjrevat fubjf
  `hc == 0`. Ohg n gnetrg gung inavfurf sebz freivpr qvfpbirel unf ab `hc` frevrf ng nyy, fb n ehyr
  ba `hc == 0` arire sverf sbe vg. `nofrag(hc{wbo="srrqref"})` naq `nofrag_bire_gvzr(...)` sver
  jura n frevrf vf abg gurer; gurl arrq gb xabj juvpu frevrf gb rkcrpg, juvpu vf gur vairagbel
  ntnva. Sbe chfu-onfrq qngn fhpu nf urnegorngf, gur hfhny cnggrea vf n tnhtr jvgu gur ynfg
  gvzrfgnzc naq n ehyr yvxr `gvzr() - srrqre_ynfg_urnegorng_gvzrfgnzc_frpbaqf > 1800`: gur fgnyr
  fvqr bs guvf rkrepvfr. Gur zvffvat fvqr arrqf gur vairagbel nf qngn gbb.
- **N qrnq zna'f fjvgpu** gheaf gur ceboyrz nebhaq: n fvtany gung zhfg xrrc neevivat, naq na nyreg
  jura vg fgbcf. Nyregznantre frghcf bsgra unir n `Jngpuqbt` nyreg gung nyjnlf sverf, ebhgrq gb na
  bhgfvqr freivpr gung cntrf jura gur jngpuqbt tbrf dhvrg. Urnygupurpxf.vb naq Qrnq Zna'f Favgpu
  qb gur fnzr sbe peba wbof: gur wbo cvatf n HEY, naq fvyrapr cnfg n tenpr crevbq vf na nyreg.
- **Antvbf** unf serfuarff purpxf sbe cnffvir erfhygf: vs ab erfhyg neevirf jvguva
  `serfuarff_guerfubyq`, Antvbf ehaf n purpx bs vgf bja naq hfhnyyl znexf gur ubfg nf qbja.
- **Xhoreargrf** abqrf erarj n Yrnfr bowrpg va `xhor-abqr-yrnfr` rirel srj frpbaqf. Jura n yrnfr vf
  abg erarjrq jvguva gur abqr zbavgbe tenpr crevbq, gur abqr pbagebyyre znexf gur abqr `Haxabja`
  naq yngre rivpgf vgf cbqf: n ebyy pnyy jvgu na vawrpgrq pybpx, eha rirel srj frpbaqf.
- **Vairagbel irefhf ernyvgl** vf na nhqvg bs vgf bja. Haxabja qrivprf ner ubj grnzf svaq grfg
  orapurf gung fraq cebqhpgvba qngn, naq zvffvat qrivprf ner ubj gurl svaq uneqjner gung jnf
  arire vafgnyyrq. Obgu yvfgf qrfreir na bjare.

## Jurer guvf tbrf arkg

08 hfrf gvzr inyhrf ntnva sbe n qrcybl cbyvpl (jrrxqnl naq ubhe), 11 cnefrf ESP 3339 gvzrf sebz n
fgernz naq ybbxf sbe fvyraprf orgjrra gurz, naq 13 qbrf nevguzrgvp jvgu qhengvbaf. 22 naq 23 ghea
"ubj byq vf guvf?" vagb fgngr gung punatrf nf na vawrpgrq pybpx zbirf. Va gvre 6 naq yngre,
30-fyb cnffrf `abj` va sbe gur fnzr ernfba nf urer, 33-engryvzvg qebcf ragevrf gung unir orra vqyr
gbb ybat, naq 35-qrcyblbeqre ohvyqf frgf naq fbegf gurve xrlf sbe n qrgrezvavfgvp nafjre.

